<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Roofline analysis</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section shows the formulas used to derive KV cache and FFN weight read times shown in Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2 Helix parallelism ‣ Helix Parallelism: Rethinking Sharding Strategies for Interactive Multi-Million-Token LLM Decoding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
