</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Time to read KV cache per LLM layer is given by below equation. It assumes individual K and V heads to represent attention variants like GQA.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{B\times 2\times\lceil{\frac{K}{TPA}}\rceil\times Hsz\times\frac{S}{KVP}\times bytes_{param}}{MemBW}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{B\times 2\times\lceil{\frac{K}{TPA}}\rceil\times Hsz\times\frac{S}{KVP}\times bytes_{param}}{MemBW}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Time to read weights per LLM layer is given by below equation. It assumes SwiGLU activation in FFN block.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{((2\times H\times\frac{Q}{TPA}\times Hsz)+(2\times H\times\lceil{\frac{K}{TPA}}\rceil\times Hsz)+(3\times\frac{H\times F}{TPF}))\times bytes_{param}}{MemBW}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{((2\times H\times\frac{Q}{TPA}\times Hsz)+(2\times H\times\lceil{\frac{K}{TPA}}\rceil\times Hsz)+(3\times\frac{H\times F}{TPF}))\times bytes_{param}}{MemBW}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2 Helix parallelism ‣ Helix Parallelism: Rethinking Sharding Strategies for Interactive Multi-Million-Token LLM Decoding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> assumes MemBW = 8000 GB/s.</p>
</div>
